# Only source, tests, docs and safe templates belong here (2026-09-27).

# Secrets: the real env files. deploy/.env.example is the template and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt

# Legacy laptop scripts with the Telegram bot token and the terminals' admin
# password in plain text (README, DEPLOY.md → Security). They stay on the
# laptop until the token is revoked and the password changed; never commit them
# as they are. tests/test_parser_parity.py imports webhook_server.py, so that
# test needs the local file.
/webhook_server.py
/configure_httphost.py
/migration_fixed.py

# Runtime state of webhook_server.py (staff names and pass times), its temp
# file and the manual copies taken before filter changes.
attendance_state*.json
attendance_state*.tmp

